              "text": "q6–12h for 10 days; use sodium/potassium",
              "pdf_page": 1402,
              "printed_page": 1320,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Antibiotics"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "salt (IV) on the first day and procaine",
